[{"location":"notes.html#Tokamak-fields","page":"Notes","title":"Tokamak fields","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"mathbfB = boldsymbolnabla xi + fracr^2qR boldsymbolnablatheta","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"where q is safety factor.","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"Jacobian: J = boldsymbolnabla xi^1 cdot boldsymbolnabla xi^2 times boldsymbolnabla xi^3 = frac1sqrtg","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"Gradient: boldsymbolnabla = boldsymbolnabla xi^i fracpartialpartial xi^i","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"Divergence: boldsymbolnabla cdot mathbfA = frac1sqrtg fracpartialpartial xi^i ( A^i sqrtg )","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"Curl:   If mathbfB = boldsymbolnabla times mathbfA then B^i =  frac1sqrtg epsilon^ijk fracpartial A_kpartial xi^j","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"sin zeta = -fracyR quad cos zeta = fracxR","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"beginaligned\n  hatzeta = -sin zeta hatx - cos zeta haty \n  hattheta = - sin theta hatR + cos theta hatz\n  hatmathbfR = cos zeta hatx - sin zeta haty\nendaligned","category":"page"},{"location":"notes.html","page":"Notes","title":"Notes","text":"From the above equations, it can be concluded that hattheta = - sin theta cos zeta hatx + sin theta sin zeta haty + cos theta hatz","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#The-ParticleTracer-Module","page":"API reference","title":"The ParticleTracer Module","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"ParticleTracer","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer","text":"ParticleTracer\n\n高能粒子追踪器\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"module"},{"location":"api.html#Module-Index","page":"API reference","title":"Module Index","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer.Pushers]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#Detailed-API","page":"API reference","title":"Detailed API","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.Para-Tuple{AbstractFloat}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.Para","text":"生成服从参数为m的抛物线分布的随机数 m 一般为小半径 r_max = a\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.SetParticlePosition_ParabolicTorus-Tuple{AbstractFloat}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.SetParticlePosition_ParabolicTorus","text":"生成抛物线分布的粒子位置\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.generate_initial_conditions-Tuple{Symbol}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.generate_initial_conditions","text":"根据配置生成初始位置和动量\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#Pusher-API","page":"API reference","title":"Pusher API","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer.Pushers]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.Pushers.relativistic_boris_step-NTuple{4, Any}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.Pushers.relativistic_boris_step","text":"relativistic_boris_step(𝐱, 𝐩, 𝐄, 𝐁)\n\nPerforms one step of the relativistic Boris algorithm in natural units (c = 1).\n\nParameters:\n\n𝐱: Position vector (normalized)\n𝐩: Momentum vector (normalized)\n𝐄: Electric field vector\n𝐁: Magnetic field vector\nq: Particle charge (normalized)\nm: Particle rest mass (normalized)\nΔt: Time step (normalized)\n\nReturns:\n\n𝐱ₙ₊₁: Updated position\n𝐩ₙ₊₁: Updated momentum\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#Fields-API","page":"API reference","title":"Fields API","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer.Fields]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.Fields.tokamak","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.Fields.tokamak","text":"环坐标下 tokamak 场\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"api.html#DataIO-API","page":"API reference","title":"DataIO API","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"api.html","page":"API reference","title":"API reference","text":"Modules = [ParticleTracer.DataIO]\nOrder   = [:constant, :type, :function, :macro]","category":"page"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.SaveConfigType","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.SaveConfigType","text":"SaveConfigType\n\nConfiguration type for data saving operations.\n\nFields:\n\nbatch_size::Int: Number of particles in each batch\noutput_dir::String: Output directory path\ntimestamp::String: Timestamp of data saving operation\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"type"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.SaveConfig-Tuple{}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.SaveConfig","text":"SaveConfig(; batch_size=1000)\n\nConstructor for SaveConfig instance.\n\nParameters:\n\nbatch_size: Number of particles per batch, defaults to 1000\n\nReturns:\n\nSaveConfig instance\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.create_index_file-Tuple{@NamedTuple{batch_size::Int64, output_dir::String, timestamp::String}}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.create_index_file","text":"create_index_file(config)\n\nCreate index file recording information for all batches.\n\nParameters:\n\nconfig: Save configuration\n\nIndex file contains:\n\nTotal number of particles\nBatch size\nTotal number of batches\nCreation time\nSimulation timestamp\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.merge_process_files-Tuple{@NamedTuple{batch_size::Int64, output_dir::String, timestamp::String}}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.merge_process_files","text":"merge_process_files(config)\n\n将所有进程的临时数据文件合并为最终批处理文件。 此函数应在所有计算完成后调用，且只应在主进程(进程1)上执行。\n\n参数:\n\nconfig: 保存配置\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.read_metadata-Tuple{Any}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.read_metadata","text":"read_metadata(g_meta)\n\nRead all metadata attributes from HDF5 group.\n\nParameters:\n\ng_meta: HDF5 metadata group\n\nReturns: Dictionary containing all metadata\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.read_particle_data-Tuple{Int64, String}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.read_particle_data","text":"read_particle_data(n, timestamp)\n\n读取指定粒子的数据。\n\n返回： 包含位置、动量、磁场（和电场，如果存在）以及元数据的字典\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_metadata-NTuple{5, Any}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_metadata","text":"save_metadata(g_ptc, global_n, x0, p0, B0)\n\n保存粒子的元数据。\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_particle_data-Tuple{ParticleTracer.PtcStruct.AbstractParticleData, Int64, Any, Any, Any, @NamedTuple{batch_size::Int64, output_dir::String, timestamp::String}}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_particle_data","text":"save_particle_data(ptc_data, n, x0, p0, B0, config)\n\n保存粒子数据，使用进程级批处理策略。每个进程写入自己的临时文件，之后合并。\n\nParameters:\n\nptc_data: 粒子轨迹数据\nn: 全局粒子编号\nx0: 初始位置\np0: 初始动量\nB0: 初始磁场\nconfig: 保存配置\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_single_particle-Tuple{Any, Any, ParticleTracer.PtcStruct.MagneticParticleData, Vararg{Any, 4}}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.save_single_particle","text":"save_single_particle(file, particle_id, ptc_data, global_n, x0, p0, B0)\n\n保存单个粒子数据到 HDF5 文件。\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"api.html#ParticleTracer.DataIO.update_batch_metadata!-Tuple{Any, Any, @NamedTuple{batch_size::Int64, output_dir::String, timestamp::String}}","page":"API reference","title":"ParticleTracer.DataIO.update_batch_metadata!","text":"update_batch_metadata!(file, batch_number, config)\n\nUpdate or create global metadata for batch file.\n\nParameters:\n\nfile: Open HDF5 file\nbatch_number: Current batch number\nconfig: Save configuration\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"examples.html#Examples","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html#Banana-trajectory","page":"Examples","title":"Banana trajectory","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"(Image: banana)","category":"page"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"# PhysicalConstants\nimport PhysicalConstants.CODATA2018 as C\nc = C.c_0.val\nmₑ = C.m_e.val\n\n# simulation parameters\nΔt = 1.0e-1\nN = 1 # number of particles\nTotalSteps = 4000000 # total steps\nSavePerNSteps = 10000 # Save 1000 steps\n\n# tokamak parameters\nB0 = 2.0 # Magnetic strength (T)\nE0 = 2.0 # Electric strength (V/m)\nR0 = 1.7 # Major radius of torus (m)\na  = 0.4 # Minor radius of torus (m)\n\n# initial conditions\nx0 = [1.8, 0, 0] # initial position (m)\nunit_p= mₑ * c\np0 = [5, 1, 0]*unit_p # initial momentum (kg*m/s)\n\nptc_type=:electron # particle type\n\n# pusher=:boris # pusher type\npusher=:RVPA_Cay3D","category":"page"},{"location":"examples.html#Passage-particles:","page":"Examples","title":"Passage particles:","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"(Image: passage)","category":"page"},{"location":"examples.html#Multiple-Particles-in-Discrete-Fields","page":"Examples","title":"Multiple Particles in Discrete Fields","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html#\\alpha-particles-loss-in-EAST","page":"Examples","title":"alpha particles loss in EAST","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"(Image: EAST)","category":"page"},{"location":"examples.html#\\alpha-particles-ITER","page":"Examples","title":"alpha particles ITER","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"# simulation parameters\nΔt = 0.1\nN = 4 # number of particles\n# TotalSteps = ceil(Int, 40000*2π) # total steps\nTotalSteps = 400000\nSavePerNSteps = 100 # Save 1000 steps\n\n# tokamak parameters\nB0 = 5.18 # Magnetic strength (T)\nE0 = 2.0 # Electric strength (V/m)\nR0 = 6.2 # Major radius of torus (m)\nr_max  = 2.0 # Minor radius of torus (m)\n\nu = Unit(B0, \"alpha\")\nB0 /= u.B # Magnetic strength (T)\nE0 /= u.E # Electric strength (V/m)\nR0 /= u.x # Major radius of torus (m)\nr_max /= u.x # Minor radius of torus (m)\n\n# initial conditions\ninit_type = :parabolic_torus\nμ = 1.000938997514917\nσ = 0\nsinθ_min = 0.0\nsinθ_max = 1.0\nϕ_min=0.0\nϕ_max=2π\n\nis_data_saving_on = false\nis_merge_process_files_on = false\n\n\nuse_electric_field = true  # 控制是否使用电场的开关\nptc_type=:alpha # particle type\n\n# pusher=:boris # pusher type\npusher=:RVPA_Cay3D\n# pusher=:relativistic_boris_step\nfield=:discrete","category":"page"},{"location":"examples.html","page":"Examples","title":"Examples","text":"(Image: cos_theta_0)","category":"page"},{"location":"index.html#ParticleTracer","page":"Home","title":"ParticleTracer","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"index.html","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"ParticleTracer is inspired by http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2017.07.009","category":"page"},{"location":"index.html#Getting-started","page":"Home","title":"Getting started","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"index.html","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"ParticleTracer is not a registered Julia package, and it can be installed by running:","category":"page"},{"location":"index.html","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"] add https://github.com/junyixu/ParticleTracer.jl.git","category":"page"},{"location":"Contact.html#Contact-Developer","page":"Contact Developer","title":"Contact Developer","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"Contact.html","page":"Contact Developer","title":"Contact Developer","text":"If you have questions, suggestions, or are interested in contributing, feel free to reach out our developer, Junyi, via junyixu0@gmail.com.","category":"page"}]
